      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, very concise. However, the auditor flagged it as \"dangerously brief\"—the score was way lower than the threshold for a \"comprehensive\" guide. \n\nCan you expand on this? I need more detail on the specific commands and maybe some context for the environment setup. Just keep it technical and useful—again, please don't just pad it with fluff or filler paragraphs just to satisfy the word count metric. I want the high score, but I want it to actually help a junior dev who might be confused about why they are doing these steps. \n\nCan you beef it up a bit while keeping it professional?",
